<title>FRANCE: Alcatel suspended limit up.</title>
<headline>Alcatel suspended limit up.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Alcatel Alsthom were suspended limit-up for 15 minutes and will requote at 1425 GMT after the share rose by 9.95 percent to 674 francs, the SBF French Bourses Association said.</p>
<p>The new upper limit has been set at 707 francs and a lower limit at 641 francs.</p>
</text>
